# Regenerable and machine-local run artifacts — not source.

# The full catalogue feed, ~116MB. Over GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit, so
# committing it would fail the push outright. Rebuild with:
#   node tools/eprolo/08-crawl-feed.mjs      (~29 min, 649 pages)
feed-cache.jsonl

# Resume checkpoints. Machine-local: they record which product ids this
# particular run finished, and are meaningless on another checkout.
ingest-state.json
full-run-state.json

# Run output.
*.log
